    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The secrets of deities, dogma, faith, and the realms of divine creatures both sublime and sinister are open to you. You also understand how magic works, though your training imparts a religious slant to that knowledge. Even if you're untrained in Religion, you can use it to Recall Knowledge."
        }
      ],
      "indent": "none",
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 3,
        "endLine": 3,
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 310
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "indent": "block",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Recall Knowledge"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "strong"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " (page 231) about divine agents, the finer points of theology, obscure myths regarding a faith, and creatures of religious significance (like celestials, fiends, and undead), Creation's Forge, the Void, and the Outer Sphere."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 5,
        "endLine": 5,
        "startOffset": 312,
        "endOffset": 558
      },
      "type": "list"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Religion Trained Actions"
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "origin": {
